WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.520
Well, everybody.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:27.020
You must've been surprised
at the previous episode.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.520
Well, I can't blame you.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:33.780
After all, the defending champion
of the Gundam Fight...

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:36.820
...Master Asia,
the Undefeated of the East...

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:39.030
...turned out to be a follower
of the Devil Gundam.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.080
You don't have to be Domon
Kasshu to find it hard to believe.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:47.500
However...

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.500
...fate can be cruel.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:54.130
Domon, along with the Shuffle
Alliance, who arrived on the scene...

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:59.550
...must challenge the traitorous
Master Asia to a Gundam Fight.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:00.840
Yes.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.750
To find the truth that lies beneath.

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:05.310
And now!

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:09.770
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:15.820
Warrior's Crest - Goodbye Shuffle Alliance

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.280
Eliminate my master?!

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:24.780
Domon...!

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.200
Yes.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.630
The decision has
already been made.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:34.290
Master Asia has forgotten the
mission of the Shuffle Alliance...

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:37.500
...and has turned into a traitor,
siding with the Devil Gundam.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:41.630
Therefore,
we must now eliminate him.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.640
That can't be...

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.440
Master has become an enemy?

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.120
I still can't believe it.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.610
We're only capable
of speaking the truth.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.700
Who are you people, anyway?

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.200
Ace of Clubs
We are the Shuffle Alliance.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.070
Queen of Spades
An ancient association...

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.490
Black Joker
...that maintains order of the Fight.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:07.660
Jack of Diamonds
...that maintains order of the Fight.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:09.410
You monitor the fighting?

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:13.390
It's a pity, but the history of
humankind is founded on battles.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.420
The Shuffle Alliance possesses
supremacy...

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:22.840
...in the world of military arts.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:26.640
Those bearing its crest have
watched every war in history...

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.740
...and have numerous times
saved humankind from extinction.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.690
As a result...

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:36.480
...humankind has learned from
this legacy of terrible massacres...

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:39.480
...and has developed the most
advanced form of combat...

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:42.040
...the Gundam Fight.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.740
We understood its meaning...

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.620
...when Master Asia entered
the previous Tournament...

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.660
...and won the championship
representing the Alliance.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.210
But I don't know what's
wrong with him now.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:58.170
Not only is he disrupting the order
by ignoring the Gundam Fight...

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:02.000
...he's also attempting to
stir up another storm of battles.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.300
In order to prevent this...

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:07.470
...we must fight against
Master Asia...

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:10.390
...and you are obligated
to join us in our battle!

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:12.940
But I...

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:14.140
Domon Kasshu...

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.020
...don't tell me you're...

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:20.110
...not willing to submit to
our noble intentions!

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:21.110
What?!

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.560
So, this is the Fighter trained
by that traitor, Master Asia...

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.120
...the King of Hearts.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.250
But I wonder...

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:40.040
Domon! I have a message for Domon!

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:44.840
A message from Master Asia,
the Undefeated of the East.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:45.680
What's that?

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:46.880
Hear this.

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:50.220
Come to the Tokyo Tower
within one hour.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.390
Do as I say, and I guarantee
the safety of the city.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:54.930
However...

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.140
...you must come alone.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.860
Under no circumstances are you
to bring the Shuffle Alliance.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.190
Is that clear?

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.440
Master is calling for you.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.190
You can't go!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.990
This is all a setup!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.780
I know he's planning
something terrible!

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:10.660
Please, don't go to him!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:11.780
Shut up!

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.120
Listen...

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.540
This is between Master and me.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.080
Stay out of this.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.380
You're in no condition to fight!

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.630
Domon! Wait!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.590
Domon!

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.350
What a fool.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.980
What'll we do, Joker?

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.020
We'll just have to leave him alone.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:43.190
Besides, it'll give us a chance
to see whether or not...

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:47.490
...he's a man that's really worthy
of the King of Hearts title.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:16.890
Here he is!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.400
Domon Kasshu's alone.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:23.940
Then let's make this quick
and get rid of him.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:25.050
I won't have that.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.030
It'd be too much of a waste
to eliminate him.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:33.370
He does have a natural talent,
after all.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.540
We shall capture Domon...

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.370
...before that annoying
Shuffle Alliance mobilizes.

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:58.430
Master, what happened to you?

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:01.230
I have trouble believing this.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.940
Through that rigorous training...

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:05.110
...you were the one who
guided me and taught me...

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.480
...the soul of the martial artist.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.410
Master!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.370
Listen, Domon...

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:28.210
A martial artist's hands are not
used only to defeat his opponent.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:32.640
You might wonder what else
they're used for.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.180
Master!

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:38.430
Listen.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.640
Work on improving every
form of hand thrust to its limits.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.390
And then...

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:47.360
...you will be able to use it as a
means of expressing your soul.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:49.610
Expressing my soul?

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.400
With this hand?

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.670
Now, eat.

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.630
It'll help you grow
and become a top martial artist.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:09.670
Yes.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:14.340
So you can express the path
you've taken with your own hands.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.470
Yes, sir!

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:19.060
Then answer me.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:20.770
The Undefeated of the East is...?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:22.020
The winds of the king!

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.390
Zenshin keiretsu!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:24.890
Tempa kyoran!

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:28.580
Look! The East is burning red!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.370
Master.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:45.960
Why would someone as great
as you do something like this?

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:48.130
I refuse to believe it.

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:49.670
There's got to be some reason.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.800
Am I wrong?
Master!

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:56.630
We've been waiting for you, Bro!

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.050
Bonjour, Domon.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:02.430
Y-you guys!

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:11.230
Now, Domon. Come to me.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:15.070
That is if you're able to
defeat these guys first.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.320
Master!

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:17.700
Get him!

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.070
Prepare yourself!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:20.580
Domon Kasshu!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:40.680
Stop it, Sai Saici!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:42.310
Over here!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:45.020
Domon! Hurry up and surrender!

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:48.440
Bastard!

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:50.100
Chibodee!
Come to your senses!

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:52.520
You're the one who must
come to his senses.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:53.730
George!

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:57.490
Wasn't our aim to keep
improving our skills?!

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:01.160
That's precisely why
you should join us.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.120
A-Argo!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:15.400
Now, why don't you just
give yourself up and accept...

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:17.130
...Master Asia's invitation?

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:23.050
Once you do that, you'll be
rewarded with great power.

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.110
Shut up!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.480
Listen!

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:32.020
The power you guys acquired
is nothing but superficial.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:36.320
Your true power should be used
to express yourself!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.990
If the man leading you
is the true Master...

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.610
...he would've taught you that!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:42.870
Then go ask him yourself...

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.240
...whether he's real or a fake!

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:00.340
Come out, you fake!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.720
You're not my master!

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.050
Don't be a fool!

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.510
Tell me your little stories...

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:08.600
...after you've actually
laid a finger on me!

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:21.070
Hey! Domon!

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.740
There's no escape for you.

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:27.660
Come on, Bro.
Get with it and join us.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.290
Okay, Bro?

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.160
Domon. Take our advice.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:41.220
Where's that vigor
you showed earlier?

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:42.970
Master...

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:44.340
Now...

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.930
...you must pledge your loyalty
to the Devil Gundam.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:50.390
Your brother would be
happy to welcome you.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:10.120
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:18.800
Okay, Domon. Come.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:22.170
Let us all together pledge our
loyalty to the Devil Gundam.

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.180
Okay? Come on, Bro.

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.090
Domon!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:29.680
I would rather not have to kill you!

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:31.930
Is this the end?!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.100
You're pathetic!

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.940
Giving up without a fight.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.570
You call yourself a martial artist?

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.650
I'm ashamed a coward like you...

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:45.150
...can call himself
the King of Hearts.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:46.780
How dare you?!

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.410
After all, martial artists are...

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:52.500
...people who can convey
their feelings in only one way...

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.410
...by grappling with their fists!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:58.500
Therefore, you must take
everything you believe in...

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.250
...and entrust it to your fists!

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:02.590
Right!

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.840
If I trust everything I've learned...

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:09.050
...and if I put my entire soul
into these fists and fight...

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.510
...I'm sure Master will
see the light!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:16.850
What are you doing?!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:21.440
I'm putting it all on the line in
the name of the King of Hearts!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.690
Rise!

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:25.780
Shining Gundam!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.750
That bastard!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:40.670
Master!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:43.300
I wish to do battle with you,
one-on-one!

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:46.380
In the form of a Gundam Fight!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:49.970
Interesting.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:50.970
I accept.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.020
That's more like it!

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:57.350
Let's get our Gundams!

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.190
Hold it!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:04.110
The King of Hearts wished
for a one-on-one match.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.030
No others can join.

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.610
The Shuffle Alliance?!

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.030
Don't get in our way!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.750
Wh-why they're...

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:22.250
What's the matter,
Jack of Diamonds?

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.210
Could these men be...?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.260
Here they come!

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.220
I did it!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.200
What's wrong?

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:53.450
Considering all your bragging...

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:57.040
...your fists haven't even
touched my body once.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:00.580
Is that the extent of your
so-called abilities?

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:12.840
Here I go!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.710
I have no desire for
senseless butchery.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:50.470
But we cannot ignore those who
choose to side with Master Asia.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:00.730
What's going on?

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.230
Our own techniques...

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:03.560
...are ineffective...

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.360
...against them?!

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.270
That's right. Look at that!

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:14.160
Those guys are
unbelievably strong.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:20.120
I've never fought like this.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.580
I'm getting a total rush!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:25.960
Those are...

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.540
...the crests of the...

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:28.710
...Shuffle Alliance.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:30.000
Yes.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.510
In that moment...

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:36.010
...I felt the same powers of life
as our own in their bodies.

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:40.890
They are in fact the successors
of the Shuffle Alliance.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.480
So that's why...

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:51.070
It's amazing!
Hard to believe!

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.820
We have to face the facts.

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:53.700
What now?

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:54.770
Joker?

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:58.240
We've got little choice
but to save them.

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.120
So then, we'll do it?!

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.870
It's the only way.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:06.250
There's only one path
that's been left open to us.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.080
Right!

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:15.720
Let the flames that light up
our lives blaze in glory!

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.100
What's that?

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:27.520
Wh-where am I?

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.310
What are you doing?

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:33.530
Are you sacrificing your own
lives to return them to normal?!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:35.490
What good will that do?

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:39.070
Have you given up
trying to defeat me?!

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:42.240
We're prepared to do
what we must.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:44.370
Although we'll pass away...

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:48.000
...our aspirations will live on
within these young patriots.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.800
What's going on?

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.000
Domon Kasshu!

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:55.170
We are leaving the fate
of the Shuffle Alliance...

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:57.050
...in your very capable hands...

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:59.930
...King of Hearts!

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.520
We're counting on you.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:09.650
No! Stop it!

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:31.080
We're counting on you,
Domon Kasshu.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.460
Their lives...

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.070
Those are...

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:25.640
M-Master?

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:38.780
Master!

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:41.200
They were such fools!

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.200
Just to save a bunch of brats...

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.600
...they tossed away their own lives!

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:03.050
Why, that's...

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:20.940
Shining Gundam Super Mode!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.370
It's nothing but a trick!

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:42.970
- Damn!
- Shining Finger!

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:47.850
Domon!

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.930
Master!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.080
I'd better retreat for now!

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:38.400
What?

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:40.480
Hey, what happened to us?

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:43.320
I last remember Master Asia
challenging me to a bout.

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:46.490
Th-this is...

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:49.990
...a crest like Domon Kasshu's.

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:52.220
Why are they appearing
on our hands?

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:10.390
Won't these fists ever express
my soul...

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:11.970
...and once again reach Master?

00:22:28.070 --> 00:22:32.700
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:37.080
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.370 --> 00:22:41.540
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:45.090
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:52.260
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:52.760 --> 00:22:57.980
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:03.230
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:09.780
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:13.910
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:19.910
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:34.970
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.180
It's the resurrection of that
gigantic evil machine!

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:43.860
As the Gundam team is joined
by the Fighter from Neo Germany...

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:48.320
...will Domon be able to defeat
his brother, Kyoji?!

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:50.400
This is a must see!

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:52.570
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:56.490
Ultimate Power and Evil!
Rise of the Devil Gundam

00:23:54.320 --> 00:24:00.890
Ultimate Power and Evil!
Rise of the Devil Gundam

00:23:56.490 --> 00:23:59.180
Ready! Go!
